# The control for the Grimoire's "You don't lose the game for having 0 or less life": the same Bolt at the same life total
# without it. Bot1 at 3 life takes Bot2's Lightning Bolt to 0 and loses to its life total (CR 104.3b, 704.5a).

[Life]
Bot1: 3

[Bot1 Deck]
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mountain
Lightning Bolt
Island x17

[Actions]
Bot1.Pass
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot2.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Red)
Bot2.Hand.Lightning Bolt.Cast(Bot1)
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
[Expect]
Result = Bot2 won
Bot1.LostTo = Life
Bot1.Life = 0
